Training pets: when your pet drops an item next to you, reward it by 
tossing it a food item it likes (tripe ration, meatball, a corpse 
(?))...

If you want your pet to follow you down stairs, wait on the stairs until 
it is on a square next to you, and then go downstairs. It will always 
follow you, then.

To make your pet come near the stairs, make sure you don't let it wander 
too far away from you in the first place. If you cross the entire level, 
leaving it on the other side, it may become confused and unable to find 
you.

